        "name": "Stop the virtual display",
        "description": "Stops the Xvfb display after the server stopped.",
        "code": "//refAssemblies: System.Diagnostics.Process.dll\nusing System.Diagnostics;\n\nvar Globals = new TCAdmin.Scripting.Engines.Addons.CSharpGameGlobals(); // DO NOT MODIFY THIS LINE\n\n// The service\u0027s virtual display is not needed while the server is stopped.\nusing (var kill = Process.Start(new ProcessStartInfo(\u0022pkill\u0022, new[] { \u0022-f\u0022, \u0022^Xvfb :\u0022 \u002B ThisService.ServiceId \u002B \u0022 \u0022 }) { UseShellExecute = false }))\n    kill.WaitForExit();\n",
